    {
      "game": "Mistfall Hunter",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/17856/450x258/mistfall-hunter-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1785852000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/17856-buy-mistfall-hunter-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Ugotta Play",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31314304-1785720465.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Great game here. Steal of a price as well. I already got 36 hours on this. Graphics are good, and gameplay is good. One of the most fun games I have played all year. Think Arc Raiders and Dark and Darker, but closer to I don't want to say Nightreign as its not as fluid as that. Yet the game mechanics are very good. It is heavy PVP so be prepared."
    },
    {
      "game": "The Relic: First Guardian",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21459/450x258/the-relic-first-guardian-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1785852000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21459-buy-the-relic-first-guardian-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Ugotta Play",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31314304-1785720465.jpg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "The game is just not worth the price. It feels like an early access game. If this was 20 bucks and Early access then I would say yes its a buy. The graphics are ok, the story is ok, nothing great and nothing horrible. The gameplay and fighting, skills, etc are all pretty good. Like a little bit above avg. The game feels undertested and just raw. There are some things I do like, but overall I would say save your money and wait for a really good sale. Unless they have massive updates and soon, you should see this sub 20 in a few months."
    },
    {
      "game": "The Mound: Omen of Cthulhu",
